WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.592
Mom: Ricky, wake up. It’s time to get up.

2
00:00:05.593 --> 00:00:09.141
Ricky: I don’t want to get up.

3
00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:13.824
I want to sleep more.

4
00:00:13.825 --> 00:00:17.692
Mom: Get up, Ricky. We have to go.

5
00:00:17.693 --> 00:00:20.487
Ricky: Can I stay home, Mom?

6
00:00:20.488 --> 00:00:24.488
Mom: No, Ricky. Your father has a meeting today.

7
00:00:24.489 --> 00:00:26.557
He can’t stay home.

8
00:00:26.558 --> 00:00:32.321
Ricky: I don’t want to go. Your office is boring!

9
00:00:32.322 --> 00:00:36.213
Mom: Ricky Raccoon, get up and get ready now!

10
00:00:36.214 --> 00:00:47.498
Ricky: Okay! I’m getting up.

11
00:00:47.499 --> 00:00:51.216
Ricky: Woo-hoo! Toys!

12
00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:55.214
Mom: Sorry, guys. Those toys are for

13
00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:58.022
patients. You have to stay in my office.

14
00:00:58.023 --> 00:01:01.213
Ricky: That’s not fair, Mom!

15
00:01:01.214 --> 00:01:03.881
Your office is not fun. Rachel:

16
00:01:03.882 --> 00:01:06.897
Mom, Ricky pushed me! Mom:

17
00:01:06.898 --> 00:01:14.789
Follow me. I have a surprise for you.

18
00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:18.058
Ricky: Wow! Lego blocks.

19
00:01:18.059 --> 00:01:21.798
Rachel: And a dollhouse. Thanks, Mom!

20
00:01:21.799 --> 00:01:25.423
Mom: Go and open the freezer, Ricky!

21
00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:27.927
Ricky: Is this for us, Mom?

22
00:01:27.928 --> 00:01:30.282
Mom: Yes, it’s for

23
00:01:30.283 --> 00:01:34.243
you. But not until after lunch─if you’re good!

24
00:01:34.244 --> 00:01:43.672
Ricky: Thanks, Mom. We’ll be good.

